   Kowal, Julia; Chami, Mohamed; Baumgartner, Paul; Arheit, Marcel; Stahlberg, Henning, Univ Basel, Biozentrum, Ctr Cellular Imaging \& NanoAnalyt, CH-4058 Basel, Switzerland.
